&Scoped-define SELF-NAME B-exit
&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CONTROL B-exit Dialog-Frame
ON CHOOSE OF B-exit IN FRAME Dialog-Frame /* Ввод */
